ansparency note (responsible AI): https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/ai-foundry/responsible-ai/openai/transparency-note\n\nSDKs and references\n- SDK language support (Python, C#, JS/TS, Java, Go) with Azure OpenAI v1: https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/foundry/openai/supported-languages\n\nIf you want, I can narrow this to a specific task (for example, Python quickstart, Assistants, “on your data,” or quotas) and pull the exact steps and sample code."}

